{"meta":{"id":"basic-types","category":"it/syntax/java/types","title":"기본 타입 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"기본형 8개(int, long, double, boolean …) 와 참조형(String), 래퍼 클래스, var","tags":["java","f-types"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">기본 타입 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 기본형 8개(int, long, double, boolean …) 와 참조형(String), 래퍼 클래스, var</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기본형 (primitive) · 참조형</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">타입</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">예시</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>byte / short / int / long</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1 / 2 / 4 / 8 byte 정수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>int n = 10; long l = 10L;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>float / double</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">4 / 8 byte 실수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>double d = 3.14;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>char</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자 하나 (2 byte)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>char c = &#x27;A&#x27;;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>boolean</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">true / false</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>boolean ok = true;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>String</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열 (참조형, 불변)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>String s = &quot;hello&quot;;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>var</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">지역 변수 타입 추론 (Java 10+)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>var list = new ArrayList&lt;String&gt;();</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기본형 vs 래퍼 클래스</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">int a = 10;            // 기본형 — null 불가, 값 자체\r\nInteger b = null;      // 래퍼 클래스 — 객체, null 가능\r\nList&lt;Integer&gt; list;    // 제네릭에는 래퍼만 (List&lt;int&gt; 불가)\r\n\r\nfinal int MAX = 100;   // 재할당 불가 (TS 의 const)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 기본 타입 — TS 는 number 하나, Java 는 크기별 정수 · 실수 구분</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/types/basic-types","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/java/types"}],"hasImage":false}